<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 243-4 AT TEA IN REPLY TO AUSTRALIA'S 182.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 243-4 AT TEA IN REPLY TO AUSTRALIA'S 182.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 243-4 in reply to</p>
<p>Australia's 182 in their first innings at tea on the second day</p>
<p>of their one-off test on Friday.</p>
<p>Score: Australia 182. India 243-4 - tea.</p>
</text>
